  "label": "User projected onto the person with a shaved head as a chemo patient",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the person with a shaved head, who is being represented as a 'chemo patient' in the meme. The text explicitly refers to 'a chemo patient', and the visual of the person is used to embody that role. The user sees themselves as the one who might engage in the described act, or is being invited to imagine themselves in that role, thereby projecting themselves onto the visual entity. This projection is reinforced by the degrading and exploitative nature of the text, which frames the person as an object of sexualized exploitation.",
